(xxviii)
"State Authority" means the State Ground Water Authority established under section 3;
(xxix)
"State Watershed Management Council" means the State Water Council constituted under section 16 of the
Maharashtra Water Resources Regulatory Authority Act, 2005;
(xxx)
"Talathi" means revenue functionary at the level of village or group of villages;
